    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Wurrband",
    "summary": "**[[PSYCHIC]](vsdata:weapon-ability/psychic)** attacks by your **ORKS PSYKER** models get +1 S, and another +1 S per 5 models in the model's unit (or embarked within the model).\n\nYour **ORKS PSYKER** models get these [psychic abilities](vsdata:core-rule/psychic-abilities):\n\n**Roar of Mork (psychic level 1)**: during [your Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase), unless the unit is **battle-shocked**, it can roll a D6 as a **psychic roll**. If it does:\n\n- a 1 makes the unit battle-shocked\n- pick an enemy unit, other than a **MONSTER** or **VEHICLE** unit, up to 12\" from the unit; that enemy unit takes a [Battle-shock roll](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock), the **PSYKER**'s unit giving -1 to it per 10 models\n\n**Visions of Violence (psychic level 1)**: as [either player's Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) begins, unless the unit is **battle-shocked**, it can roll a D6 as a **psychic roll**. If it does:\n\n- a 1 makes the unit battle-shocked\n- the unit gets [Fights First](vsdata:core-ability/fights-first)",
